{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkeSvZ9n7VKmmBdTF3co","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ok, I'm out. I have my number and my date.\n\n**What I'd tell my friend:** From what I saw, I can take the money out tax-free after 6 years. Their example puts about 66,000 ₪ in your hand after 5 years. I'm fairly sure about the 6 years and not so sure about the 66k. That example uses 300 ₪ a month from me and 900 ₪ from the employer, so it isn't my salary. It also takes money out after 5 years, which is before the 6, so tax gets taken. So after 6 years it should be a bit more, I guess.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top:** I read the heading \"קרן השתלמות\" and the line \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך… בלי מס\". That gave me the \"when\" straight away.\n- **Next screen:** There were some shekel numbers (15,712 ₪, 20,566 ₪) and a row of buttons. I scrolled past them.\n- **Calculator (\"כמה כסף נשאר לכם, ומתי?\"):** It was set to \"שכירים\". I saw 7.5 / 2.5 / 0.54 / 7 in the boxes and didn't touch them. The bar chart says \"מושכים את הכסף אחרי 5 שנים\" and has red \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\". The big numbers I saw were +54,000, +8,487 and a red −13,974, which scared me. The last number, \"66,5…\", was hidden under the round arrow button.\n- **Text under the chart:** I found \"נשאר בידיים 66,601 ₪ עד 66,280 ₪\". That's what stuck. It also says something like \"29,768 ₪ למס הכנסה\" and then \"15,794 ₪ מהם חוזרים\". I didn't really get it. Does a third of it go to tax? Do I get some back?\n- **Then:** I glanced at the \"שווה לדעת\" headings and the \"מי מציע\" bit with הראל and אלטשולר שחם, and stopped there.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- Why would the example take the money out at 5 years when the page itself says wait 6? The first thing I see is the taxed scenario with a red minus. I'd want it to start at year 6.\n- I didn't know if I could tap \"6\" on the chart, and I didn't try.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"ריאלי\"-type stuff like \"במחירים של היום\", \"מסלול מדד\", \"הטבת מס\", the \"KH-19\" / \"PF-18\" tags, and \"חוקים וכללים · 10\".\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- Start the calculator at 6 years.\n- Don't hide the final number under the scroll-up button.\n- Put a box for my own salary right at the top.\n- Explain the tax-back thing in one line."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2051,"cache_read_input_tokens":13775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2051},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58185651-4ec4-47ac-bc7c-ce0c6481dfd3","uuid":"7d4d8968-059d-49e7-a6fc-3b03594e5767","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:26:39.099Z","request_id":"req_011CgkeSvLFVXyzcyajpfTUx"}
